You are an expert full-stack developer. We are building an "Editorial Quick Read" app.
Tech Stack: React Native (Expo), Supabase (PostgreSQL, Edge Functions, Auth), Next.js (Website), and Gemini 1.5 Flash.

Core Architecture Rules:
1. Daily Batch: RSS ingestion and AI summarization must happen at 5:00 AM IST (23:30 UTC) via Supabase Cron.
2. AI Constraints: Every summary must be exactly 80 words. Include an 'Author Stance' field.
3. Database: Use Supabase. Use pg_cron and pg_net for scheduled tasks.
4. UI Style: Clean, typography-focused "Digital Magazine" feel. Serif fonts for content.
5. Performance: Serves cached summaries from DB, never call Gemini live from the frontend.

